      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسمّتهُ</span></b> , (As, S, A, TA,) [and] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسمّت لَهُ</span>,
(M,) <i>He directed himself,</i> or <i>his course,</i> or <i>aim,
to,</i> or <i>towards, him,</i> or <i>it;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَدَهُ</span>, (S, M,) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَمَّدَهُ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَدَ نَحْوَهُ</span>. (As, A, TA.)

